:: Africa Q1 {"position":"800,450","size":"100,100"}
*Burton poses a question.*
**Question 1 of 4: Burton examines a brass head from the Kingdom of Ife. Who is most likely represented by this Ife head?**

[[A ruler or high-status figure from Ife, suggested by the elaborate crown and formal style->Africa Q1 ok]]

(link: "An ordinary farmer from Ife, shown with tools and clothing used for agricultural work")[ (goto: "Africa Q1 no") ]

(link: "A Benin court official from southern Nigeria, identified by coral regalia and palace bronze plaques")[ (goto: "Africa Q1 no") ]

(link: "A Nok terracotta figure from central Nigeria, recognized by its ancient clay and geometric facial features")[ (goto: "Africa Q1 no") ]



