(link: "A senior member of a local ritual association during ceremonies connected with authority")[ (goto: "Africa Q4 no") ]

(link: "A community elder during public ceremonies marking transitions in village life")[ (goto: "Africa Q4 no") ]

(link: "A trained performer during masked events connected with moral instruction")[ (goto: "Africa Q4 no") ]



