:: Americas Q4 study {"position":"175,1325","size":"100,100"}
(set: $tries to 0)
*History:* The story: La Muerte Enramada embodies the core Day of the Dead idea that life and death form one unbroken cycle. The skeleton is not a symbol of ending but of regeneration — death is the seed from which new life grows.

[[Finish region->Americas Done]]



